<title>USA: DDB Needham to buy majority stake in Brazil's DM9.</title>
<headline>DDB Needham to buy majority stake in Brazil's DM9.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>DDB Needham Worldwide said on Friday it agreed to purchase a majority interest in DM9 of Sao Paulo, making the Brazilian advertising agency part of DDB Needham's international network.</p>
<p>The terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>DDB said in a news release that DM9 has current annual billings of $210 million and was founded eight years ago.</p>
<p>DDB Needham is a unit of Omnicom Group Inc.</p>
</text>
